13. Transfer Status Model
The UI must use the exact status enum exposed by the backend. A representative model is:
SUBMITTED → PROCESSING → COMPLETED
SUBMITTED → UNDER_REVIEW → APPROVED → PROCESSING → COMPLETED
UNDER_REVIEW → REJECTED
PROCESSING → FAILED
Do not overstate a failure
A generic UI failure message must not say “your account was not debited” unless the API contract explicitly guarantees and communicates that condition.

