27. Transaction Failure and Rollback
Source debit succeeds in current DB transaction
         ↓
Destination credit fails
         ↓
Exception
         ↓
Database transaction rollback
         ↓
Source debit rolled back
Ledger writes rolled back
Transfer/outbox writes rolled back (if in same transaction)
The frontend must show the backend failure state; it never attempts balance repair or compensating SQL.
